{"code":"YL14","wikidata":"Q119010493","wikipedia":{"en":"Srinagarindra 38 MRT station","th":"สถานีศรีนครินทร์ 38"},"summary":{"en":"Srinagarindra 38 station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Yellow Line. The station is located on Srinagarindra Road in Prawet District, Bangkok and is named after Srinagarindra 38 Road which branches off from the main road. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีศรีนครินทร์ 38 เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้ามหานครแบบยกระดับในเส้นทางสายสีเหลือง โดยยกระดับเหนือถนนศรีนครินทร์ในพื้นที่เขตประเวศ กรุงเทพมหานคร"},"opened":"2023-06-03","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Srinagarindra_38_Station_03.jpg/960px-Srinagarindra_38_Station_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Srinagarindra_38_Station_03.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Srinagarindra_38_Station_01.jpg/960px-Srinagarindra_38_Station_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Srinagarindra_38_Station_01.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a1/Srinagarindra_38_Station_02.jpg/960px-Srinagarindra_38_Station_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Srinagarindra_38_Station_02.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Srinagarindra_38_Station_04.jpg/960px-Srinagarindra_38_Station_04.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Srinagarindra_38_Station_04.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/